 depicted above. Which of the following diagrams shows the vectors $3\\mathbf{a}$ and $-\\mathbf{a}$?" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying by $3$ preserves direction and triples length. Multiplying by $-1$ reverses direction and preserves length. The correct diagram therefore has a long vector pointing northeast labeled $3a$, and a vector one-third as long pointing southwest labeled $-a$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186097032 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8120675e-74e2-5aa5-8cbf-db2abc8f109e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/41/416a18fd3a2a11c7fbb0ce2fdd3ed75b83410396e8ec52b8a7c993745ca81b4d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094166} {:answer/id #uuid "ed07a06b-80ba-50f5-89c6-e0a481b51456" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6c/6c907ff40a90580aad820b8ac461aed59fc55f1e98d5c79f56f60437fdf08890.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094167} {:answer/id #uuid "f4cd0334-67e8-5261-b4ce-8230e36aba22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c0/c03ee884a33c8edc202df3de774ab352649eaf3c319d0097c8fc1c9bc504b1aa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094168} {:answer/id #uuid "6b191158-7808-5d59-bd26-046f3a9557c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5c/5cd9e52874ba6c0d9b72b309ff3223498f830d48eb1d43bdfbccdbc8c8cd6469.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094169} {:answer/id #uuid "6ef56eda-a107-5390-9358-102a190bd297" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e9/e95ebaf8e3be645cb7d75d5b473aab45841cbeb114f24a47e0f97af1f7c31db6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094170}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8120675e-74e2-5aa5-8cbf-db2abc8f109e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/41/416a18fd3a2a11c7fbb0ce2fdd3ed75b83410396e8ec52b8a7c993745ca81b4d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094166} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa9fb757-41da-596f-8d49-c9a1b0447d8a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186094165}] :question/id #uuid "e2326efc-0c50-5a93-bc92-424305d03002" :question/math-academy-id "q-12140" :question/problem "![](images/f5/f54e51921dfd2fb1b93bccec89553e174e2527866352626a5bf0846956b096bb.png)\n\nThe diagram above shows the vector $\\mathbf{a}$. Which of the following diagrams shows the vector $-\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{a}$?" :question/worked-solution "The vector $-\\tfrac12a$ has half the length of $a$ and the opposite direction. The original vector points northeast, so the correct diagram shows a vector half as long pointing southwest."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503923 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a74ec89-a73d-5a31-ba2d-793fa1584a74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0c/0c4830e2a745cca228683b98a915fb1c22fafcab353624b8ee66b5c5dfb8ffd4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503922} {:answer/id #uuid "369c05e9-0650-5920-babb-41ee27a8a507" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8f/8f3cb7a4117916bb483ad874474fe44748efdc80ab10d87de4582d75b1a6830c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503945} {:answer/id #uuid "4d8f952a-2c4c-5ff7-824f-ff825ef6ea7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0f/0f3ee0939f0ed2b647ecaaf5c731c48d40d2cb601ae597672a5b819d385a36db.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503952} {:answer/id #uuid "c8eb1c4d-5028-54b4-bbec-827f3e18b14a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/05/05ca0637c4707b64c683ffdabda4335e92bb91519181d4a706f04f1aabb863b3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503995} {:answer/id #uuid "f8c91953-fb94-56bb-9321-2c922049601b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c5/c5ae3d645aaa0a5cae7a8c5ee0b346310591eaf2bc884475c930ceff3f5bdb68.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504018}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f8c91953-fb94-56bb-9321-2c922049601b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c5/c5ae3d645aaa0a5cae7a8c5ee0b346310591eaf2bc884475c930ceff3f5bdb68.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504018} :answer-field/id #uuid "158a14f8-a7fa-5f86-ad23-f0fe4f59ba5d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503927}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0ad91052-6847-54a3-94f7-e0dcea362c59" :question/problem "![](images/55/55ac7d0e79f21610191ebb3c861bb1a5d8e3eaf3ad625ad121e7f815bdc3c517.png)\n\nThe diagram above shows the vector $a$. Which of the following diagrams shows the vector $-\\frac{3}{2}a$?" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ must be parallel to $a$.\n\nNow, for the vector $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ is $\\frac{3}{2}$ times the magnitude of $a$.\n- Vectors $a$ and $-\\frac{3}{2}a$ have opposite directions since the factor $-\\frac{3}{2}$ is negative.\n\nThe required vectors are shown below.\n\n![](images/c5/c5ae3d645aaa0a5cae7a8c5ee0b346310591eaf2bc884475c930ceff3f5bdb68.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503931 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2628b656-dd22-53e7-a2d9-e4343567af08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/9f/9f0b0931aadbc18528b5ac6bbf6e6d5539d40138d67819729e3c6d716964d922.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503938} {:answer/id #uuid "3785f1ec-04a0-500b-88cf-d2bb7367efa7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/52/52ecefb3db162b4e67c6ae7e3f4c546c1a779788e3b00e3302d3ae468b88123f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503946} {:answer/id #uuid "5ec70842-71a0-539d-925a-d0a0adbdb306" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/7f/7f63c606fff90d3d867a8b24a50855cc66c0fbb9e97748f429f5a53641f29c67.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503954} {:answer/id #uuid "82b33c46-f9f5-5628-a109-cef62b189443" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b3/b37adc4bbc907e8c44bb4c06a7e636d172f0d2b65edbba485fbc