ectors $a$ and $2a$ have the same direction since the factor $2$ is positive.\n\nThe required vectors are shown below.\n\n![](images/4c/4c184c372b1dd3618f46ccb5a4ec7cb131cc6de29dc0641adc9cb54a516d7d3d.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186627945 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "47634c6d-32c5-52a6-967c-b8bdad4dbba3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/4a/4ac3b243ac452f5c0198142e39dd3d87ebdfc0a9325353481909c77cbff11569.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627950} {:answer/id #uuid "5b8e8f27-9955-5cc7-8c87-41546cfafe4e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d5/d57e3e9fb4aea1736a4a9f2dcbb67e73ddd6c683c1701396e19156606d9066b3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627959} {:answer/id #uuid "5cd1f65c-9849-503a-ac60-2a73bdb6dda7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/30/30e94b87f32c8ab2e9b4d67faa09fa1581705c6f0c212ca857e0bf987bdd6366.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627960} {:answer/id #uuid "8254b220-f195-577d-8b84-82f7327c9718" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f4/f434715d40491a16a85275acdcf069d344766b7387c9ec068aaac9945aa68dbe.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627966} {:answer/id #uuid "a230940c-30f1-5b85-bd80-1d5b5cbf1f61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d4a0b82b7cc4135940464404e7429a3949d10577a43a0bffebd392c257485346.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627969}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a230940c-30f1-5b85-bd80-1d5b5cbf1f61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d4/d4a0b82b7cc4135940464404e7429a3949d10577a43a0bffebd392c257485346.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627969} :answer-field/id #uuid "4ef16886-5a75-5b46-867c-5bba2ca73ed2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627954}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "28084314-fca4-5724-a510-72910f10ee0e" :question/problem "![](images/1f/1f94ae6ec9c86b20ce4d872836d19739244668fdd6347d987046fd79c354fb1f.png)\n\nThe vector $a$ is depicted above. Which of the following diagrams shows the vectors $\\frac{3}{2}a$ and $-2a$?" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that both $\\frac{3}{2}a$ and $-2a$ must be parallel to $a$.\n\nNow, for the vector $\\frac{3}{2}a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $\\frac{3}{2}a$ is $\\frac{3}{2}$ times the magnitude of $a$.\n- Vectors $a$ and $\\frac{3}{2}a$ have the same direction since the factor $\\frac{3}{2}$ is positive.\n\n![](images/c6/c6022d0b5774dbb5dba7427fa75774fc9294301933c7008d91f01d23ca40b040.png)\n\nNext, for the vector $-2a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $-2a$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $a$.\n- Vectors $a$ and $-2a$ have opposite directions since the factor $-2$ is negative.\n\nThe required vectors are shown below.\n\n![](images/d4/d4a0b82b7cc4135940464404e7429a3949d10577a43a0bffebd392c257485346.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186627956 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "210909fb-e83f-52d6-b3da-897f63faab01" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f6/f65cd32c91eca34ba70bd1207dc7751091ea52fccb4708b68b462419bf74a84c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627944} {:answer/id #uuid "3194bf1f-8004-5c98-860f-a4906a8068ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/14/14f7d4c33dfb5cfbcfbe881d00562e023ffb02ad3a644784562b7419aab608ab.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627946} {:answer/id #uuid "489a7339-0c7c-5632-b506-9a53fdd4f8d0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/bb/bbed94add04cd93ca3cd847584642c579730b72b02730d95480f4bbe7a52fde3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627951} {:answer/id #uuid "4a5bb795-ca10-5831-b1c7-46d359d7be1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/05/054d302156ca1c95dcf24f005347004f6460ac40120266987c230746c3e136fe.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627952} {:answer/id #uuid "e87da707-586d-547e