 factor $-3$ is negative.\n\n![](images/fe/fec41e0bb69863877ff80245f444f39d93d78c1c3f49ae1dcfdadfa3c33f2a6b.png)\n\nNext, for the vector $\\frac{3}{2}a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $\\frac{3}{2}a$ is $\\frac{3}{2}$ times the magnitude of $a$.\n- Vectors $a$ and $\\frac{3}{2}a$ have the same direction since the factor $\\frac{3}{2}$ is positive.\n\nThe required vectors are shown below.\n\n![](images/9c/9c53ecd9372f2c1cc8c1420d5de94e8434076582754841c7189945e29c59114b.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186627967 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3478b242-fdd7-51fb-9d85-b8ceeb81c663" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/71/716b10ddfa9a63251d093c19ead8534cd957dd1ce625ce2ed68f13b2cf03549d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627948} {:answer/id #uuid "61e23d58-e7b6-5366-bfae-b32e89455737" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0a/0a71930ccadc981e97f747225471e01c2f78d724ac930cbd68e0a635c0f394e8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627961} {:answer/id #uuid "6fe1f26c-6737-5ad6-9f5f-cc6de1218d48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/86/8655baf5ead1a2984570712000d3e0247c6e77aadf61bc0c23cb2cc705d3211d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627964} {:answer/id #uuid "77e5281d-b906-576d-b1c3-07fa1604cd61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8b/8bef121d32c2cd315180bf84bc6c968f8069ce04267f115d142d387dab15386c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627965} {:answer/id #uuid "ea4d13ae-4fb5-59bc-82a8-8c242975a9b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b7/b7a8e357dbe7e3af5d859158eb5c785c401b26d360c4347b3ce16afdaf33230e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627973}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ea4d13ae-4fb5-59bc-82a8-8c242975a9b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b7/b7a8e357dbe7e3af5d859158eb5c785c401b26d360c4347b3ce16afdaf33230e.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186627973} :answer-field/id #uuid "b0cd9d02-8